# Pocket Forex — Git exception

This project **overrides** the global “user owns all Git” restriction.

## Allowed here

- The agent **may** `git add`, `git commit`, and `git push` when the user asks to commit, push, ship, or when a Cursor commit/push action is selected.
- Follow normal commit hygiene: stage only related files, concise messages, never force-push `main` unless explicitly asked, never skip hooks unless asked, never amend unless the usual amend rules are met.
- Read-only git (`status`, `diff`, `log`) stays fine.

## Still forbidden (global rules still apply)

- Prisma migrate / apply / reset / wipe commands
- Destructive git (`push --force` to main, hard reset) unless the user explicitly requests it
- Updating git config

## Prisma

Unchanged: do not run Prisma migrate commands.
